{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"8599b7763963d7f6cf470cb70d2655909d3e69fdfc58e82c3bc2246f0142ece5","digest":{"component_or_area":"reconciler operation runtimes","key_entities":["src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/runtime.py","src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_backend_registry.py","ReconcilerSettings","GitRuntime","BridgeRuntime","reconcile-check","load_config()","tests/interfaces/store/test_reconciler_operation_bindings.py"],"problem_keywords":["reconciler","read paths","configuration isolation","ambient mutation","jira backend","immutable settings","S1 snapshot"],"propositions":["Reconciler read/check paths must use focused immutable runtime projections instead of ambient load_config() calls that can reload settings mid-operation","A single selected Jira backend (Cloud or Data Center) must be constructed at operation start with stable project/query scope, TLS, timeout, and auth, with no further ambient environment changes affecting it","Custom tracker directory, branch, and remote parameters must thread through all read owners consistently without fallback to ambient defaults or root-B mutations","Missing or conflicting auth, empty project/query scope, or malformed configuration must fail before any Jira API request or local write","Secrets must not appear in backend repr, exceptions, logs, cache keys, or wire boundaries except when unwrapped in the authenticated sending adapter"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787541771472059001,"uuid":"52ba7694-716b-44a9-998a-7f928eb6dc39"}